//RS     /// D-MEM-COPYSEM1: a folded aggregate constant (text, list, map, option,
//RS     /// result, tuple, or nominal value) on a hosted target is one shared
//RS     /// per-thread value; a read holds it in a `JetSharedSlot` and borrows it
//RS     /// in place, and only an owned use copies it. Scalars stay plain values.
